{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_02_end","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":5,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_02_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-2","storyName":"寂静长廊的两端","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"若麦在综艺节目上说着迎合观众却违心的话，而祥子在想办法进入录制现场的过程中，被莫菲丝假扮的票贩坑骗。在企鹅物流的一路追击下，祥子带着台上的若麦，破窗逃离了现场。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_02_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_02","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":3,"next":5,"characters":["主持人","空","祐天寺若麦","忙碌的保安","激动的粉丝","丰川祥子","？？？","奇怪的男人","巡逻的保安&丰川祥子","巡逻的保安","可颂","企鹅物流员工","莫菲丝","卡尔顿们","通讯器里的声音","祐天寺若麦&空"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_bg_65_g8_interviewstage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$farce_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_farce_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"各位观众朋友们好！下面让我们有请今天的人气嘉宾——空小姐！","id":9},{"type":"dialog","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_101_sora_1#6","duration":"0.7","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_takphtrptly","volume":"0.7","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":15},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.2","id":16},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_101_sora_1#6","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":19},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.2","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#6","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":23},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#6","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"左边的朋友——右边的朋友——还有中间的朋友！","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_char_101_sora_6.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"嗨！我是来自塞壬唱片的，大家的偶像空~！","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_char_101_sora_6.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cheer_street","volume":"0.4","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"大家的热情都很高涨啊！！","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"有这么多人喜欢我，我真的很开心！","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_char_101_sora_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"不过我想，肯定也有很多人是因为临时官宣的另一位嘉宾而欢呼，她同样也是我的偶像哦！","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_char_101_sora_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#1","focus":"n","id":38},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwdcheerup","volume":"1","id":39},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#3","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"multiline","name":"空","text":"唔，大家已经等不及了吗？","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"multiline","name":"空","text":"那就让我们欢迎——若麦小姐！","id":44},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#5$3","duration":"0.7","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#5$3","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"晚上好喵呣喵呣~~","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"粉丝朋友们好呀，我是若麦~见到大家我太开心了！","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cheer_street","volume":"0.8","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":55},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_bg_bg_lmstreet_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"in","id":62},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"in","fadetime":"2","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的保安","text":"有入场凭证的才能进场！","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的保安","text":"无关人士都往外面站，不要拥挤！","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的保安","text":"*龙门粗口*，人太多了，根本管不过来啊！","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_033","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的粉丝","text":"空小姐......若麦小姐！我爱你们啊！！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_npc_033.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.6","id":73},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的保安","text":"喂，那个人冲进去了——快拦住他！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_020","duration":"0.3","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_020","duration":"0.3","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":85},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......这里已经完全一团乱了。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"人实在太多了。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......完全没有混进去的可能。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"n","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"小姑娘，想进场看大明星吗？","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"你喜欢哪个？空，还是若麦？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"我有办法带你进去，亲眼见到本人哦。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......你为什么要帮我？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CF/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"哎，别这么紧张嘛~","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"我要价也不高......喏，这个数。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......我给不起。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"哎，这价格已经很低了啊！你可别想着再砍一刀！","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"就算你这么说......","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pcket","volume":"1","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"（虽然这个男人看着就很可疑，但是现在也没什么别的更好的办法了，如果错过这次机会......）","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"（只能先相信他了。）","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"（翻找口袋）","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"一共只有这么多......这是我身上全部的钱，你看行不行？","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"也成！跟我来吧！","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":121},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":125},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"in","fadetime":"2","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"员工专用通道......？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"嗯，咱们就从这里进。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"入场凭证呢？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"没有啊。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那你是内部人员？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"不是啊。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那我们怎么进去？要是被发现了怎么办？！","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"我和你说了我有办法啦！你到底想不想见到明星？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"（小声）*龙门粗口*，声音太大了......","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"charslot","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_020","duration":"0.7","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"（小声）他要过来了！趁他还没发现，我们快——","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"喂！你怎么在这呢？！","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"charslot","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"all","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"all","id":167},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的保安&丰川祥子","text":"呃啊——！","id":169},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"不是跟你说让你守着备用器材随时待命吗？","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"别想着当助理就能偷懒，待会道具组临时需要备用器材咋办？！","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"才多大年纪啊，就想着偷懒不干活？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的保安","text":"哎，她都吓得说不出话了，你给人家留点面子嘛。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"还傻站着干什么啊？快去会场啊！","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......我知道了。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"charslot","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的保安","text":"小姑娘，会场在那边......","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"你别告诉她！","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"我就等着她找不到再跑回来求我！因为她耽误时间而造成的损失，全部从她工资里扣！","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的保安","text":"小姑娘，工作加油啊！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"好......好的。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"快点走吧，别磨蹭！","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":210},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":213},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"charslot","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的保安","text":"唉——这年头，还真是什么活都不好干啊......","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"0.6","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"喂喂，你那边情况怎么样？","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的保安","text":"一切正常。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"charslot","id":228},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_bg_bg_pgbase_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsfrom":"1,1","tsto":"0,1","tsduration":"0.1","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1","focus":"n","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡逻的保安","text":"一切正常。","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"那就好。继续巡逻吧。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"啊——头都要大了！根本忙不过来！","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"若麦的人气怎么这么高！走到哪都有这么多喜欢她的人......","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_329_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"若麦小姐这样，一定也很累吧......","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"我看着空小姐每天起早贪黑地训练，为了回应粉丝们的爱意而四处奔波。晚上见到她时，她从来都是满脸的疲惫。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"若麦小姐一出道就迅速走红，现在除了做主播，还要演戏、上综艺节目......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"以前还能看到她发练鼓的视频，现在已经很久没看到了......","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"你很喜欢她，对吧？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_329_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"嗯......我最开始会对架子鼓感兴趣，就是因为看了她的视频。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"偶尔坚持不下去的时候，还会去看她以前的那些视频。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"不知道现在的她，还会不会像《少女鼓手》里那样开心地玩音乐呢？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"......","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_329_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"啊！对不起，自顾自说了很多。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"企鹅物流员工","text":"现在还是工作时间，保证空小姐的安全最重要！我们还是继续盯监控吧！","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"没事的啦，也不用那么紧张。最近从供应商那进了点新产品，可以自动识别未授权的访客——","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":264},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#14$1","focus":"n","id":266},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_aircraftalarm","volume":"0.5","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"不会吧......","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"快去看看A区那两个可疑的人，准备无人机！","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":279},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$chasing_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_bat_chasing_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":280,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":282},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":283},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"a","id":285},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"b","delay":"0.2","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"c","delay":"0.4","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"狭长的走廊里，两个人像着了魔一样飞奔，而他们身后是数十架攻击型无人机。","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我就不该......不该信你！！","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CF/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"真是怪了！之前带人这么溜进来都没问题啊！","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"这些监控和无人机什么时候有的？！","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":297},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"d","id":298},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"e","delay":"0.2","id":299},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"f","delay":"0.4","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"哎，无人机要追上来了——再跑快点，快点啊！","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_305_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_305_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"all","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":307},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":310},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":311},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"2","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":314},{"type":"charslot","id":315},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"（奇怪的声音）","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇怪的男人","text":"嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻......哈哈哈哈哈哈！！","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"——！","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"祥子发现，方才还在身边的男人突然间不见了踪影，取而代之的是一张熟悉的面孔。","id":326},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","duration":"1","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈——太好玩啦！！","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_2","volume":"1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（欢乐的叫声）","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"怎么样，你喜欢这个孩子的美梦吗？","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我看她沉浸在大家的爱意里，完全不想回去呢~","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这些都是你搞的鬼？！","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我早就说过了——既然是挑战，就不会那么轻松。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"快让我去见她！","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你想见她倒是不难，沿着这条走廊一直往前，一直往前，就能见到啦！","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"不过恐怕你现在应该考虑的是，怎么甩掉后面这些东西~","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shdwblwvr","volume":"0.6","id":349},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_1","volume":"1","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（赞同的哼唧声）","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":356},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":358},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"1.5","id":359},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"g","id":361},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"h","delay":"0.2","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"i","delay":"0.4","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":364},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"0.6","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_329_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":367},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_201_moeshd_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"她在往录制现场跑，空有危险——快拦住她！","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_201_moeshd_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","text":"","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":377},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......可恶！","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CF/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":382},{"type":"charslot","id":383},{"type":"text","text":"祥子感到自己脚下的地板开始莫名变得柔软，她和前方大门的距离被无限地拉长，奔跑与噩梦一样无休无止。","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"祐天寺，你快点给我醒过来啊！！","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯器里的声音","text":"跟上她的动作，镜头推近——","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯器里的声音","text":"对，再近一点，对准她的脸，移到苍白的嘴唇。","id":397},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlight","volume":"1","id":399},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_spotlight_02","layer":"1","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$4","duration":"1","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":403},{"type":"text","text":"“人偶存在的意义是什么？”","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"“摆在精致的橱窗里，模仿着橱窗外人们的动作。”","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"“用拙劣的效仿，博得人们的欢笑。”","id":406},{"type":"text","text":"“人偶开心，人们欢喜。”","id":407},{"type":"text","text":"“人偶悲伤，人们欢喜。”","id":408},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"“接下来，请欣赏人偶为您带来的表演——”","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$4","focus":"n","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯器里的声音","text":"......完美。","id":414},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":416},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":417},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":418},{"type":"charslot","id":419},{"type":"bgeffect","id":420},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_bg_65_g8_interviewstage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":422},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":423,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cheer_street","volume":"0.5","id":424},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#3","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"好、好厉害......","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_101_sora_3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":429},{"type":"charslot","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"这就是天生的表演奇才啊！！","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"嘿嘿，我也是最近才能拿捏准这种感觉的。","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"每天晚上对着例片，在镜子前一遍又一遍练习，尝试理解人偶的想法。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"charslot","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"理解人偶？听起来有点奇怪呢，哈哈......","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#1","focus":"m","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"若麦小姐能演绎成这样，一定付出了非常多的汗水吧！","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_char_101_sora_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"......因为我常常会觉得自己缺乏才能嘛。","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"身边的大家都有着非凡的能力。","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":444},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","action":"zoom","afrom":"0","ato":"0","poszoom":"0.4,0.72","scale":"1.85","duration":"0","focus":"m","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-550,180","posto":"-550,180","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":449},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-550,180","posto":"-550,180","afrom":"0.7","ato":"0","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":451},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":452},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#13$1","action":"zoom","afrom":"0","ato":"0","poszoom":"0.4,0.72","scale":"1.85","duration":"0","focus":"m","id":453},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"350,180","posto":"350,180","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":455},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"350,180","posto":"350,180","afrom":"0.7","ato":"0","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":457},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","action":"zoom","afrom":"0","ato":"0","poszoom":"0.4,0.72","scale":"1.85","duration":"0","focus":"m","id":459},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":460},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-650,180","posto":"-650,180","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":461},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":462},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-650,180","posto":"-650,180","afrom":"0.7","ato":"0","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":463},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":464},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#11$1","action":"zoom","afrom":"0","ato":"0","poszoom":"0.4,0.72","scale":"1.85","duration":"0","focus":"m","id":465},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"300,180","posto":"300,180","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"300,180","posto":"300,180","afrom":"0.7","ato":"0","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":469},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":470},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":471},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"有些人天生含着金汤匙，早早就作为童星成名。","id":474,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"有些人即使坠入谷底，却依然散发着耀眼的光芒。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我得奔跑到力竭，才能勉强追赶上她们......","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我的这些小聪明，在她们面前实在是一无是处啊。","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"所以面对那些喜欢我的人，我唯有付出几倍几十倍的努力，才能回应他们对我这个天赋平平之人的垂青。","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_101_sora_1#5","focus":"m","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"若麦小姐......你已经非常优秀了。","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_char_101_sora_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"我相信在座的所有人，都和我一样——大家都深爱着你。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_char_101_sora_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#6$3","focus":"m","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"嗯......谢谢大家。","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":485},{"type":"charslot","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"实在是让人感动啊。很有幸，今天能邀请到两位如此出色的嘉宾，与大家共度这一段欢乐的时光。","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"既然气氛已经到这里了，我突然想到了个有趣的点子——","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"在节目的最后，不如两位一起演绎一次《少女鼓手》的经典场面？","id":489},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$3","focus":"all","id":490},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_101_sora_1#1","focus":"all","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦&空","text":"好！","id":492},{"type":"dialog","id":493},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":494},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":495},{"type":"charslot","id":496},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":497},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":498},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":499},{"type":"text","text":"按照耳机里的指示，若麦和空在自己的位置站定。","id":500},{"type":"dialog","id":501},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":502},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":503},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":504},{"type":"charslot","id":505},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_bg_53_g16_sunnyday_R2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":506},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":507},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":508},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":509},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","volume":"1","id":510},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_animal_loop","volume":"0.7","channel":"bd","loop":"true","delay":"0.3","id":511},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":512},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bd","fadetime":"2","id":513},{"type":"text","text":"蔚蓝的天空，盛夏的风携来了远方的气息。","id":514},{"type":"text","text":"羽兽鸣叫。","id":515},{"type":"text","text":"呼吸声。","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"——你快从天台上下来呀！","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"不行，梦想这种东西，就是要站在最高的地方，用最大的声音喊出来呀！","id":518},{"type":"text","text":"展现完美无瑕的一面，是偶像的天职。","id":519},{"type":"text","text":"即使有时候需要一点点谎言。","id":520},{"type":"dialog","id":521},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"可是，可是，你不是才决定买架子鼓吗？！","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"万一你之后放弃了打鼓怎么办？那不会被人笑话吗？","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我已经决定了，我要打一辈子鼓！打到打不动为止！","id":525},{"type":"text","text":"可是我放弃了鼓。","id":526},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我的梦想是成为龙门第一——","id":527},{"type":"text","text":"我确实变成了众人喜爱的样子。","id":528},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"不，泰拉第一的鼓手！","id":529},{"type":"text","text":"这样就可以了，这样就行。这就是我想要的评价，这就是我想要的地位——","id":530},{"type":"text","text":"是吗？我想要的真的是这些东西吗？","id":531},{"type":"text","text":"羽兽鸣叫。","id":532},{"type":"text","text":"呼吸声。","id":533},{"type":"dialog","id":534},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":535},{"type":"text","text":"玻璃碎裂声。","id":536},{"type":"text","text":"不该出现的声音。","id":537},{"type":"dialog","id":538},{"type":"playsound","key":"$glass","volume":"0.5","id":539},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":540},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":541},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":542},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":543},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_65_i03.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","fadetime":"0","id":544},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"15","block":"false","id":545},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":546},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$lab_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_sys_lab_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":547,"musicid":3},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.4","fadetime":"3","id":548},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":549},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":550},{"type":"text","text":"夜晚肆意的冷风，依然无法让人清醒地思考此时发生的一切。","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"......欸？","id":552},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":553},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"发、发生什么了？","id":554},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空","text":"若麦小姐？！","id":555},{"type":"dialogue","name":"可颂","text":"保护好空！若麦被嫌疑人掠走了，我现在去追她们！","id":556},{"type":"dialog","id":557},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":558},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"3","id":559},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":560},{"type":"text","text":"身后传来的那一片混乱的声音，正在迅速地离她们而去。","id":561},{"type":"text","text":"当若麦回过神来，才发现她们正失控地下坠。","id":562},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这是哪门子的美梦？","id":563},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"失去鼓，失去伙伴，失去自己。就算得到再多人的喜欢，那还是你的梦吗？","id":564},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那个爱耍聪明、从不饶人的祐天寺，到底跑哪去了？","id":565},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"可是、可是......","id":566},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"若麦，梦该醒了。","id":567},{"type":"dialog","id":568},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":569},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":570},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":571},{"type":"image","id":572},{"type":"charslot","id":573}],"characters":["主持人","空","祐天寺若麦","忙碌的保安","激动的粉丝","丰川祥子","？？？","奇怪的男人","巡逻的保安&丰川祥子","巡逻的保安","可颂","企鹅物流员工","莫菲丝","卡尔顿们","通讯器里的声音","祐天寺若麦&空"]}